  "term": "metabolism",
  "definition": "Metabolism is the total set of changes taking place in a living body, including both building up and breaking down. It covers the constructive formation of living tissue from food materials and the destructive breakdown of living substance into simpler compounds that release energy for the organism’s activity.",
